+/** Encodes a projection Opus frame.
+  * @param st <tt>OpusProjectionEncoder*</tt>: Projection encoder state.
+  * @param[in] pcm <tt>const opus_int16*</tt>: The input signal as interleaved
+  *                                            samples.
